# SOP Chunk Dataset Generator
### Step 1 of the RL Disaster-Response Dataset Pipeline

## Quick Start

```bash
pip install openai
export OPENAI_API_KEY="sk-..."
python generate_sop_chunks.py
```

Output: **`sop_chunks.json`** — the knowledge base ready for conversation generation.

---

## Model Options (top of script)

| Model | Quality | Est. cost for 300 chunks |
|-------|---------|--------------------------|
| `gpt-4o` | Best | ~$1.50–2.00 |
| `gpt-4o-mini` | Good, faster | ~$0.10–0.15 |

---

## What It Does

- 10 API calls × 30 chunks each = 300 total chunks
- Round-robin across 10 disaster topics (30 per topic)
- 14 realistic official sources rotated across chunks
- OpenAI `response_format: json_object` enforces clean JSON output
- Validates fields, deduplicates chunk IDs, builds metadata

## Topics (30 chunks each)
flood and landslide preparedness · monitoring, response · evacuation · rescue · recovery · medical emergency response ·
general disaster preparedness · emergency contact information


